> Does crowning open the longsword slot regardless?

For lawful and neutral, yes.  For chaotic the broadsword slot
is opened regardless.  It's a non-obvious side effect.

Another cool side effect is the slot for your currently wielded
weapon is opened as well.  Lawfull who already dipped for
Excalibur or neutral who was already gifted with Vorpal Blade?
Try wielding a pick-axe or whatever while praying and see what
happens when you get crowned.  Look carefully at your
#enhance list before and after as well as the formerly restricted
weapon you are wielding.  Also look at the exact description
of the weapon you were wielding while crowned.



